manifest.md# FlowGenius PWA - Manifest & Business Logic## 1. PurposeA Progressive Web App (PWA) designed to automate the creation of precise flowcharts from source code input, specifically tailored for programming logic assignments and academic documentation.## 2. Core Goals- Parse source code (focusing on Python, JS, etc.) and map it to standard flowchart symbols automatically.- Provide a 100% Offline-First experience using client-side generation.- Automate academic formatting upon export (PDF, JPG, DOCX) using pre-configured "Homework Templates".- Robust History Management: Save, view, edit, re-export, and delete past flowcharts.- Persist data locally and sync bi-directionally to the cloud seamlessly.## 3. Architecture Paradigm- **Frontend:** TypeScript/JavaScript wrapped in strict Object-Oriented Programming (Classes, Interfaces).- **Backend:** Serverless, relying exclusively on Firebase Ecosystem (Firestore, Authentication).- **Offline Strategy:** Service Workers + IndexedDB caching for full offline capability.## 4. Key Features- Advanced Code Editor (Monaco Editor implementation).- Interactive Flowchart Canvas (Zoom, Pan).- Automated Academic Headers on Export.- Local Dashboard for History Management (CRUD operations).